    <string name="guide_title">How to use</string>
    <string name="guide_1">1. Make sure Shizuku is running and this app is authorized.</string>
    <string name="guide_2">2. Create a task with the target app package and launch mode.</string>
    <string name="guide_3">3. Add steps: wait for text, tap text, delay, swipe or back.</string>
    <string name="guide_4">4. Text steps read the UI tree first, then fall back to OCR.</string>
    <string name="guide_5">5. Running a task makes Shizuku tap the screen as shell to finish check-ins.</string>

